cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Chicago / Grant Park Aerial Photogrammetry and Terrestrial Laser Dataset"
abstract: >-
  2,751 full-resolution geotagged aerial photographs (41.9 GB) and 43 terrestrial laser scan
  stations covering Grant Park and the surrounding downtown Chicago blocks, captured 27-28 June
  2020 with a DJI Mavic 2 Pro (Hasselblad L1D-20c) and a FARO Focus S150. Capture density is
  deliberately uneven: the wider city is aerial photogrammetry, while the Lollapalooza festival
  field -- empty that summer after the event was cancelled -- was laser scanned at
  substantially higher detail as the primary subject. Released as unmodified source capture
  with EXIF and GPS intact, organised by flight.
